      20 - 4.1 The Snapshot Generator shall ensure that each simulation case is executed in an isolated environment (or subdirectory) to prevent file overwriting and
         race conditions.
      21 - 4.2 The Snapshot Generator shall provide a summary report at the end of the collection process, detailing the number of successful, failed, and skipped
         cases.
